izje8i","Azure API Management Classic 漏洞被用于窃取挪威能源公司密钥","Azure API Management Classic 漏洞已被用于针对挪威能源公司 Equinor 和 Skagerak Energi 等目标，攻击者可能获取了实例中存储的密钥。","source",{"_56":182,"_183":184},"publishedAt","selected",true,"SecurityWeek","firstParty",false,"dw4eyb7t4jy3oa0umleioh8vo","Microsoft Azure API Management Classic 漏洞已被利用窃取 API 凭据","Microsoft Azure API Management Classic 层级漏洞已被用于窃取客户 API 凭据，未按推荐安全最佳实践配置的实例可被未授权访问管理功能。",{"_56":190,"_183":184},"2026-11-23T19:42:20.000Z","BleepingComputer","ki39ljn444f17gu7vlna9kqka","Microsoft 修复 Azure API Management Classic 漏洞，未授权方可能访问客户密钥","Microsoft 于 2026 年 11 月 18 日发现 Azure API Management Classic tier 的安全问题，未按文档安全最佳实践配置时，未授权方可访问部分管理功能，v2 tier 不受影响；Microsoft 已于 11 月 19 日关闭访问路径，并自 11 月 21 日发布排查和轮换密钥与凭据的指导。",{"_56":196,"_183":184},"2026-11-24T10:44:49.000Z","The Hacker News","ulsxnbhozl8xkickryxgocmpe","攻击者已利用 Azure API Management（APIM）Classic 层级漏洞，窃取客户实例中存储的凭据，受害者包括挪威的 Equinor、Skagerak Energi 等多个组织。",{"_56":200,"_183":184},"Help Net Security",{"_204":214,"_13":14,"_20":195,"_17":164,"_207":215},{"_204":210,"_13":211,"_20":189,"_17":164,"_207":212},{"_204":205,"_13":206,"_20":21,"_17":133,"_207":208},"factId","fdpjCK9lDhbs","微软修复Azure API Management漏洞","representative",{"_173":174,"_13":175,"_28":176,"_177":209,"_179":21,"_180":181},{"_56":182,"_183":184},"fUXoa9Bh5o4A","披露Azure APIM漏洞被利用",{"_173":185,"_13":186,"_28":187,"_177":213,"_179":189,"_180":184},{"_56":190,"_183":184},"flS8weV7RH-Y",{"_173":191,"_13":192,"_28":193,"_177":216,"_179":195,"_180":184},{"_56":196,"_183":184},"participants48h","newParticipants6h",0,"recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",6,{"_225":226,"_227":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
